- Reducing the time required to integrate new sensors, devices, and functionalities;
- Improving issue diagnosis and analysis of robot behaviour;
- Ensuring seamless cooperation between robot software, embedded systems, and the cloud platform;
- Contributing to the migration and development of ROS 2-based solutions;
- Preparing software for deployment across a growing robot fleet.

